cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, methodology, or published search records, please cite it using this metadata."
type: software
title: "SETIsearch: Panchromatic (8.273-Octave, 0.0905-28.00 um) Space-Lyman to JWST Thermal-IR, VLT X-shooter/GIRAFFE/FEROS Optical-IR Laser, Frequency-Comb, Radio & Photometric Technosignature Pipeline"
abstract: >-
  Prospectively locked, reproducible archival searches and pure-stdlib numerical audits
  for panchromatic space Lyman-limit/FUV/NUV (FUSE 0.0905-0.1187 um, HST/COS G130M
  0.1125-0.1450 um, HST/STIS E140M 0.1145-0.1710 um, HST/STIS E230M/E230H 0.1605-0.3150 um),
  ground near-UV (VLT UVES_NUV), optical (HARPS, HARPS-N, ESPRESSO HR/UHR, OHP SOPHIE,
  OHP ELODIE, CFHT ESPaDOnS, MPG/ESO FEROS, VLT FLAMES/GIRAFFE HR), far-red (VLT UVES_RED,
  CARMENES_VIS), 3-arm simultaneous UVB+VIS+NIR (VLT X-shooter 0.2989-2.4790 um),
  near-infrared YJH (NIRPS_HE), thermal J/H/K (VLT CRIRES+), SDSS APOGEE-2 H-band,
  simultaneous YJHK (CFHT SPIRou APERO 0.7.295), and JWST space thermal-IR (NIRSpec G235H
  1.655-3.072 um, NIRSpec G395H 2.862-5.179 um, MIRI LRS 5.0-12.0 um, MIRI MRS Ch1-4
  4.900-28.00 um including Townes 10.60 um CO2 laser and Project Hephaistos
  OBJECT_D/OBJECT_E) laser, multi-epoch linear drift, molecular CCF, and periodic
  frequency-comb technosignatures (0.0905-28.00 um, 8.273 unbroken octaves across
  23 spectrographs / 29 arms; 373 unique stars and 2,238 archival exposures totaling
  702.8369 h across V3.0-V5.2 + COMB_V4_1 with Keplerian planetary de-Doppler across
  125 orbital campaigns, 44 N>=3 multi-epoch drift campaigns, union-excluded JWST MIRI LRS
  + NIRSpec G395H molecular CCF, G8_V52 novelty gating, and uniform all-sky COMB_V4_1
  matched filtering across 100% of D079-D094 / 424 stacks), unified with
  planetary-rest-frame 1.4 GHz narrowband radio searches (Parkes/GBT) and TESS specular
  light-sail photometry achieving 23/23 (100%) radio-echelle closure across a 373-system
  multi-messenger synthesis (0 verified ETI detections; 0.0973 W HST_STIS Proxima Cen,
  0.2194 W HST_COS GJ 832, 0.4294 W FUSE Alpha Cen A, 0.14238 kW JWST_NIRSPEC_G395H
  CWISEPJ1935, 0.20533 kW JWST_MIRI_LRS Luhman 16AB, 228.98 W JWST_MIRI_MRS WISE0855 at
  5.80 um, 0.26757 kW CARMENES_VIS GJ 3512, 0.33023 kW VLT X-shooter LAWD37, and 41
  panchromatic optical+IR/radio bridges across 664 cells including 16 Cyg B and GJ 849).
